sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Foydalanuvchi
    participant SA as Social Analytics
    participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>(Fernet shifrlash)
    participant P as Provider<br/>(YouTube/VK/Meta)

    U->>SA: "Akkaunt ulash" tugma
    SA->>SA: state token yaratish<br/>(CSRF himoyasi)
    SA-->>U: 302 → Provider auth URL<br/>?client_id&scope&state
    U->>P: Provider sahifasi<br/>(login + ruxsat berish)
    P->>P: Foydalanuvchi tasdiqlaydi
    P-->>U: 302 → /callback/?code&state
    U->>SA: GET /callback/?code&state
    SA->>SA: state tekshirish
    SA->>P: POST /token<br/>{code, client_id, secret}
    P-->>SA: {access_token, refresh_token, expires_in}
    SA->>SA: Fernet bilan shifrlash
    SA->>DB: SocialAccount.save<br/>access_token = encrypted bytes
    SA-->>U: 302 → /accounts/<br/>"Ulandi" toast

    Note over SA,P: Sync vaqtida (har 6 soat)
    SA->>DB: SELECT _encrypted_token
    DB-->>SA: bytes
    SA->>SA: Fernet decrypt → plaintext
    SA->>P: GET /api/posts<br/>Authorization: Bearer ...
    P-->>SA: posts JSON
